# DoNotDev MCP reference (guidelines)

## For AI agents

1. **Root `AGENTS.md`** — read first (workflow, rules, CLI).
2. **`get_guideline("AGENT_START_HERE")`** or this file: [AGENT_START_HERE.md](./AGENT_START_HERE.md) — MCP verification and first calls.
3. **`get_guideline(...)`** — package topics, setup docs here, and WAI-WAY templates; use **`search_framework`** to explore.

Project skills live under **`.claude/skills/`** (e.g. `/brainstorm`, `/design`, `/build`, `/polish`). They are optional slash shortcuts; the same work is driven by **`start_phase` / `complete_phase`** in `AGENTS.md`.

